<title>USA: Johnsburg CSD, N.Y., won by Roosevelt &amp; Cross.</title>
<headline>Johnsburg CSD, N.Y., won by Roosevelt &amp; Cross.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
